amous legion in Rome.That's the story we wanted Invictus to let you tell: a legion that starts as farm boys with spears and, over many campaigns, becomes a name the enemy knows. So let's follow the Tenth and see how each step of their story plays out in the game.Swords, spears, horses and bowsA legion is built from four ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T15:12:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067938693","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:25:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5103930-1843481262704655","game_id":"steam-5103930","kind":"announcement","title":"Building Rome","summary":"Rome wasn’t built in a day and neither was the city of Rome in Invictus.The campaign map has gone through many iterations during development. We began by building the underlying mechanics: provinces, settlements, armies, movement, and the systems that allow the world to react to the player. At that stage, the map was primarily functional. It gave us the foundation we needed, but it did not yet feel like a living ancient world.Once those systems were in place, we could begin introducing the art, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-15T13:50:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262704655","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:25:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5103930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:53Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:53Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5103930":"2026-10-26T08:21:53Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5103930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:53Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:53Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:21:5